meta {
  name: custom-rest-endpoints — Section 04 Chapter 03 Demos
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:4004
}

docs {
  baseUrl is the app root — http://localhost:4004 — not the OData service
  root. The custom endpoints are plain Express routes, outside /odata/v4.

  Run 01-seed first: it stores the new order's key in {{orderId}}, which the
  webhook payload references.
}
